      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Official notification has been received from the Commissioner\nInvestigation that on March 24, 1972, MR. JULIO T. MULKAY of\n1291 Lathrop Avenue, Staten Island, New York, refused to answer\nquestions relevant to certain transactions being investigated by\nDepartment of Investigation.",
