      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Mr. Mulkay is an officer of the J.T. Mulkay Construction\nCorporation, whose principal place of business is at 1571 Lexington\nAvenue, New York, New York 10029.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
