    {
      "bbox": [
        149,
        1920,
        2033,
        2187
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "All contracts with the above firm or with any firm, partner-\nship or corporation of which Julio T. Mulkay is a member, partner,\ndirector or officer may be cancelled or terminated, subject only\npayment of any monies owing for goods delivered or work done\nprior to such cancellation or termination.",
