        2216,
        1990,
        2544
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In the event the above-named person or firm submit bids for\nany contract to be awarded by a City agency, the name of such\nbidder should be referred to the Board of Responsibility for\ndetermination of such bidder's responsibility in accordance with\n5(c) of the Resolution of the Board of Estimate adopted on\nJune 30, 1949 (Cal. No. 3180A), as amended.",
